<title>UK: Gazprom raises record amount for London exchange.</title>
<headline>Gazprom raises record amount for London exchange.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's RAO Gazprom raised the highest amount by a Depositary Receipt listed on the London Stock Exchange, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>RAO Gazprom issued 23.7 million American Depositary shares at an offer price of $15.75 per share - raising a record $373.275 million, the LSE said.</p>
<p>- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
